        "original_id": "6a1b6540-04cd-5a2c-ab25-a682a3721010",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Ross Case; Slobodan Živojinović\n- Events: 1974 Pacific Coast Open; 1988 Swan Premium Open\n- Roles: Australian former tennis player; singles player\n- Rankings: World No. 19\n\nFacts:\n- Ross Case was born on 1 November 1951 and is an Australian former tennis player.\n- At the 1974 Pacific Coast Open, unseeded Ross Case won the singles title, earned $16,000 in first-prize money, and received 80 Grand Prix points.\n- Slobodan Živojinović reached the semi-finals of the 1985 Australian Open as a singles player.\n- Slobodan Živojinović reached the semi-finals of the 1986 Wimbledon Championships as a singles player and achieved a career-high ranking of World No. 19.\n- At the 1988 Swan Premium Open, fifth-seeded Slobodan Živojinović won the singles title.",
